class:: Vpar
summary:: Ppar of visual patterns (play several at once)
categories:: Libraries>VisualServer
related:: Classes/Ppar, Classes/Vbind, Classes/Vseq, Guides/VisualServer

description::

Thin wrapper returning code::Ppar(list, repeats):: so several visual patterns play in parallel.

CLASSMETHODS::

method:: new
argument:: list
An link::Classes/Array:: of patterns (e.g. link::Classes/Vbind::s).
argument:: repeats
Default 1.
returns:: a link::Classes/Ppar::.

EXAMPLES::

code::
Vpar([
    Vbind(\instrument, \circle, \x, Pwhite(-0.8,0.8), \dur, 0.3, \view, \demo),
    Vbind(\instrument, \square, \y, Pwhite(-0.8,0.8), \dur, 0.5, \view, \demo)
]).vplay;
::
